  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1303.06 Reporting a School Bus Accident",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1303.06 Reporting a School Bus Accident.\n\n(a) Any accident involving a school bus shall be reported in accordance with the provisions of RSA 264 and all applicable rules.\n\n(b) In addition to the requirements of (a) above, the designee of a school district shall report any accident involving a school bus to the division within one business day of the accident.\n\nSource. #8248, eff 1-4-05; ss by #10439, eff 10-11-13 (see Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1300); ss by #14005, eff 6-22-24, EXPIRES: 6-22-34 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1300)",
